  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8202.07 Investigating law enforcement agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8202.07 “Investigating law enforcement agency” means the law enforcement agency for whom the killed, injured, or missing law enforcement officer is employed.\n\nSource. #13298, eff 11-30-21",
